  "id": "aesthesiometry",
  "term": "aesthesiometry",
  "definition": "Aesthesiometry is the measurement of sensory sensitivity or threshold. In this context, von Frey aesthesiometry is a mechanical form of quantitative sensory testing used to obtain an objective sensory threshold and help quantify neuropathic pain.",
